 top 5: 1 for {T:home:sub}, 1 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"Rankings tell you who shone over time; a match is played over ninety minutes and a few details."}},"s9":{"fr":{"lead":"Un sosie pour Patrik Schick dans les chiffres ? Andrea Belotti ({TN:Italy}, Euro 2020), avec 97 % de similarité.","keys":["Tomáš Kalas ↔ Marcus Danielson (Euro 2020, 98 %).","Tomáš Vaclík ↔ Júlio César (finales de Ligue des champions, 96 %).","Callum McGregor ↔ Djibril Sow (Coupe du monde 2022, 96 %)."],"impact":"Un jumeau n'est pas un clone : la similarité compare des profils par 90 minutes (tirs, passes, xT, défense…), pas le talent. Mais ça donne des idées au mercato."},"en":{"lead":"If Patrik Schick had a lookalike in the numbers, it would be Andrea Belotti ({TN:Italy}, Euro 2020): 97% similar.","keys":["Tomáš Kalas ↔ Marcus Danielson (Euro 2020, 98%).","Tomáš Vaclík ↔ Júlio César (Champions League finals, 96%).","Callum McGregor ↔ Djibril Sow (2022 World Cup, 96%)."],"impact":"A twin is not a clone: similarity compares per-90 profiles (shots, passes, xT, defending…), not talent. Still, it gives transfer ideas."}}}}